   "id": "s1",
   "title": "Ionising radiation arrives",
   "text": "Radiation from a radioactive source (for example radium-226) can **collide** with the atom. It needs **enough energy** to remove an electron.",
   "actions": [
    {
     "tween": {
      "ray": 1,
      "ion": 0
     },
