     "dur": 800
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "s2",
   "title": "The outer electron is lost",
   "text": "The outer electron is forced away. 11 protons and 10 electrons: the atom becomes a **positive ion (cation)**, **Na⁺**.",
